<p><a name="fn3"></a>3. See Federal Reserve Banks (2026), "<a href="https://doi.org/10.55350/sbcs-20260323">2026 Main Street Metrics: Trends over Time from the Small Business Credit Survey</a>," March 23. <a href="#f3">Return to text</a></p>

